+  /**
+   * @brief For a scalar instruction that gives the same result in FPU and VMX flush mode.
+   *
+   * fmr, fabs, fnabs, fneg, lfd*, stfd*, stfiwx, fctidz, fctiwz and fcfid never read the MXCSR's
+   * flush bits (they move bits, truncate, or convert an integer: no denormal operand is read and
